# Repository-wide ignores only.
#
# This is a monorepo: Laravel lives in backend/, Flutter in mobile/. Each keeps
# its own .gitignore with the rules for its toolchain, because a root-anchored
# path here (/build, /vendor) would mean the wrong directory for at least one
# of them.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Windows zone identifiers
*:Zone.Identifier
